exercises
1. draw what the following heap would look like after we insert the value
11 into it

ok lets analyze this

we have 10 at the 0 level/root
1st level is 9 and 8
2nd level 6 5 (child of 9) | 7 4 (child of 8)
3rd/final level 2 1 (child of 6) | 3 (single left child of 5)

insert 11 at last node -> right of 3
compare to parent: 5.
11 > 5 so swap it.

next parent is 9.
11 > 9 , swap it

next is 10.
11 > 10, swap it.

no more parent, done.
so now

level 0 = 11
level 1 = 10 | 8
level 2 = 6 9 | 7 4
level 3 = 2 1 (child of 6) | 3 5 (child of 9)

