2. draw what the previous heap would look like after we delete the root node

answer:
ok now we wanna delete 10

last node = 3
root node = 10
overwrite root node with last node
so now the rootis 3, an just 'cut' the old last node.

now trickle down. check both children
9 vs 8. since 9 is bigger val, trickle to left child.
so now root is 9 and 3 is left child of 9.

next check children again
6 vs 5. since 6 is bigger val, trickle left
so now parent = 6 and left child = 3 and right child = 5

next last chidlrne
2 vs 1. bigger val is 2
however 3 > 2 so its already in the correct place

so its done.

so correct position is

level 0/root: 9
level 1: 6 | 8
level 2: 3 5 | 7 4
level 3: 2 1 (children of 3)

end of algorithm

