3.  Imagine you’ve built a brand-new heap by inserting the following numbers
into the heap in this particular order: 55, 22, 34, 10, 2, 99, 68. If you
then pop them from the heap one at a time and insert the numbers into
a new array, in what order would the numbers now appear?

answer:

ok so i have a new heap lets evaluate the order

new heap = empty vector
insert 55 -> (55)
insert 22 -> (55 22)
insert 34 -> (55 22 34)
insert 10 -> (55 22 34 10)
insert 2 -> (55 22 34 10 2)
insert 99 -> (99 22 55 10 2 34)
insert 67 -> (99 22 67 10 2 34 55)
so its a complete 2 level tree

now we wanna pop them
(99 22 67 10 2 34 55) -> pop 99
(67 22 55 10 2 34) -> pop 67
(55 22 34 10 2) -> pop 55
(34 22 2 10) -> pop 34
(22 10 2) -> pop 22
(10 2) -> pop 10
(2) -> pop 2
() -> done

so in terms of order
(99 67 55 34 22 10 2)
where 99 is the first popped and 2 is the last popped


